Rem AMCAF and Turbo Plus commands of the first set (host only): bits, banks, the beam, pixels, memory search
Print #1,"odd";Odd(3);Odd(-3);Odd(4);Odd(0)
Print #1,"even";Even(3);Even(-3);Even(4);Even(0)
Reserve As Work 5,100
Bank Permanent 5 : Erase Temp
Print #1,"permanent";Length(5)
Bank Temporary 5 : Erase Temp
Print #1,"temporary";Length(5)
Print #1,"after"
Raster Wait 50
Raster Wait 0,60
Raster Wait 400
Print #1,"raster"
Audio Lock : Flush Libs
Print #1,"smouse";Smouse Key
Amos Pri 0 : Amos Pri 99
Set Planes 255
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
F Plot 10,10,5
Print #1,"fpoint";F Point(10,10);F Point(11,10);F Point(0,0);F Point(319,199);F Point(320,10);F Point(10,200);F Point(-1,3)
Print #1,"point";Point(10,10)
F Plot 20,20,21 : F Plot 400,20,3 : F Plot 20,-4,3 : F Plot 20,300,3
Print #1,"fpoint2";F Point(20,20)
Autoback 1
F Plot 30,30,7
Print #1,"autoback";F Point(30,30)
Autoback 0
F Plot 5,5,-1
Print #1,"not reached"
Reserve As Work 6,100
For I=0 To 98 Step 2 : Doke Start(6)+I,I : Next I
S=Start(6)
Print #1,"hunt";Word Hunt(S To S+100,0,20 To 20)-S;Word Hunt(S To S+100,0,21 To 21);Word Hunt(S+100 To S,0,98 To 98)-S
Print #1,"hunt2";Word Hunt(S To S+100,1,40 To 44)-S;Word Hunt(S To S+100,-1,2 To 98)-S;Word Hunt(S To S+100,-1,0 To 98);Word Hunt(S+1 To S+11,0,0 To 0)-S
Print #1,"hunt3";Word Hunt(S To S,0,0 To 0)-S;Word Hunt(S To S,0,2 To 2)
